This repository is a monorepo called JY-Studio.

Structure rules:
- All runnable applications must be inside /projects. Do not add runnable app code at repo root.
- Each project must be self-contained.
- Shared code must go into /libs; avoid copy-pasting across projects.
- No cross-project hard dependency without clear interface.
- Use modular architecture.
- Keep folder naming consistent (kebab-case).
- Prefer clarity over complexity.
- Generate minimal but executable code.
- Always explain structural changes before refactoring.
- Avoid breaking existing running apps.

Development philosophy:
- Codex generates scaffolding.
- Cursor refines and improves code.
- Keep commits small and atomic.
- Prefer small PRs: one logical change per PR.